OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1785925102
OL,3,CAC Milan and Italy legend Baresi dies
OL,4,Caged 66
OL,6,FItalian football legend Franco Baresi
OL,7,Fhas died at the age of 66, with his
OL,8,Fformer club AC Milan saying that "his
OL,9,Fexample and integrity will be forever
OL,10,Fetched" into their DNA.
OL,12,FBaresi, who is widely considered to be
OL,13,Fone of the greatest defenders to ever
OL,14,Fplay the game, spent his entire career
OL,15,Fwith the Rossoneri, notching up more
OL,16,Fthan 700 appearances over a 20-year
OL,17,Fspell.
OL,19,FDuring that time, he won six Serie A
OL,20,Ftitles and three European Cups, as
OL,21,Fwell as four Italian Supercups.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
