OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1785925102
OL,3,CAC Milan and Italy legend Baresi dies
OL,4,Caged 66
OL,6,FHis contribution was so significant
OL,7,Fthat the club made the decision to
OL,8,Fretire his number six shirt - and in
OL,9,F2020, he became honorary vice-
OL,10,Fpresident.
OL,12,FOn the international stage he also won
OL,13,F81 caps for Italy, winning the World
OL,14,FCup in 1982 and getting to the final
OL,15,Fin 1994.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
