PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1785925102
OL,3,CAC Milan and Italy legend Baresi dies
OL,4,Caged 66
OL,6,FAnnouncing the news of his death on
OL,7,Fsocial media on Friday, AC Milan
OL,8,Fwrote: "Milan is in tears following
OL,9,Fthe passing of Franco Baresi. His
OL,10,Fexample and integrity will be forever
OL,11,Fetched into the club's DNA, just as
OL,12,Fhis iconic number 6 shirt is."
OL,14,F"Announcing the loss of someone who
OL,15,Fembodied the heart and soul of AC
OL,16,FMilan, is incredibly difficult," the
OL,17,Fclub added.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
