PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1785925102
OL,3,CAC Milan and Italy legend Baresi dies
OL,4,Caged 66
OL,6,F"But everyone at the club and all the
OL,7,FMilanisti must live up to Franco
OL,8,FBaresi's memory. We must be strong and
OL,9,Fgather every bit of energy, even at
OL,10,Fthis saddest of times.
OL,12,F"In memory of Franco, we stand united,
OL,13,Fknowing he'll guide and push us
OL,14,Fthroughout our Rossoneri journey.
OL,15,FForever. Because Baresi is forever."
OL,17,FFierce city rivals Inter Milan also
OL,18,Fpaid tribute, writing: "Goodbye to
OL,19,FFranco Baresi, our opponent in many a
OL,20,FDerby and one of the key figures in
OL,21,Fthe history of this rivalry.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@dO]
