PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1785925102
OL,3,CAC Milan and Italy legend Baresi dies
OL,4,Caged 66
OL,6,F"AC Milan's captain, talisman and
OL,7,Flegend, in his matches against Inter,
OL,8,Fhe always walked the path between
OL,9,Fcompetitiveness and respect, in one of
OL,10,Fthe most influential fixtures in
OL,11,FItalian football history. "
OL,13,FFellow Italian giants Juventus were
OL,14,Fjust as complimentary.
OL,16,F"There are people who, with their
OL,17,Ftalent, enter history. And others who,
OL,18,Fwith their humanity, remain there
OL,19,Fforever. Franco Baresi was both," they
OL,20,Fsaid.
